  "title": "CoVLM-Bench and CoVLM-Drive for Cooperative Driving",
  "summary": "CoVLM-Bench evaluates cooperative driving question answering (CDQA) and planning (CP) on vehicle-infrastructure paired scenes, while CoVLM-Drive provides a unified VLM baseline that directly uses paired views for both CDQA and CP. Experiments show improved accuracy and safety in both tasks.",
